      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-919--d5ba5ba7c611b45c484ed0edf6e1ef81e0e37b0b32a230ef675a07b3554bc093.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-920",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "重登滕王阁",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "李涉",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "滕王阁上唱伊州，二十年前向此游。\n半是半非君莫问，好山长在水长流。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "f1ba53ee10d502e895d2bbe2259979c9e6e6b5f032fcffafd4b500cd8503047d",
