    },
    {
      "id": "tang-921",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "咏郡斋壁画片云（得归字）",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "岑参",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "云片何人画，尘侵粉色微。\n未曾行雨去，不见逐风归。\n只怪偏凝壁，回看欲惹衣。\n丹青忽借便，移向帝乡飞。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "b99713bb637c189022a77f2b802c013e2d2939a0860cbc64946f38e592bde7bd",
      "estimatedOutput": 702,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-921--b99713bb637c189022a77f2b802c013e2d2939a0860cbc64946f38e592bde7bd.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-922",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "剪彩",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "张九龄",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "姹女矜容色，为花不让春。\n既争芳意早，谁待物华真。\n叶作参差发，枝从点缀新。\n自然无限态，长在艳阳晨。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "ea341172e5908b9e80996891e775b571d959f28c3adeb3f6a6eb8c8587ebe93c",
      "estimatedOutput": 702,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-922--ea341172e5908b9e80996891e775b571d959f28c3adeb3f6a6eb8c8587ebe93c.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-923",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "颂德上贾常侍",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "贾岛",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "边臣说使朝天子，发语轰然激夏雷。\n高节羽书期独传，分符绛郡滞长材。\n啁啾鸟恐鹰鹯起，流散人归父母来。\n自顾此身无所立，恭谈祖德朵颐开。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "6253efe6a0d8a5ec1bcccd9cee55c0148e1ba3a8b029f40993dc80f1d43dd4b9",
      "estimatedOutput": 734,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-923--6253efe6a0d8a5ec1bcccd9cee55c0148e1ba3a8b029f40993dc80f1d43dd4b9.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-924",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "咏茶十二韵",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "齐己",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "百草让为灵，功先百草成。\n甘传天下口，贵占火前名。\n出处春无雁，收时谷有莺。\n封题从泽国，贡献入秦京。\n嗅觉精新极，尝知骨自轻。\n研通天柱响，摘绕蜀山明。\n赋客秋吟起，禅师昼卧惊。\n角开香满室，炉动绿凝铛。\n晚忆凉泉对，闲思异果平。\n松黄干旋泛，云母滑随倾。\n颇贵高人寄，尤宜别匮盛。\n曾寻修事法，妙尽陆先生。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "eb8ec6c63809303634a85c6c8a0b88dff697e3c1fc249ab801251e62752b0bde",
      "estimatedOutput": 910,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-924--eb8ec6c63809303634a85c6c8a0b88dff697e3c1fc249ab801251e62752b0bde.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-925",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "天宫",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "白居易",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "洛城秋霁后，梵阁暮登时。\n此日风烟好，今秋节候迟。\n霞光红泛艳，树影碧参差。\n莫虑言归晚，牛家有宿期。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "f1f2281f5a49a6e4de2b6c7b577a5593977481f96387e2deaf8e9dd5cf0491e9",
